t Journal).	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/12390743482722.jpg	Reprint	368	{"Angela Duckworth"}	Paperback	{Self-Help,Motivational,"Personal Transformation","Business & Money","Personal Finance","Health, Fitness & Dieting","Psychology & Counseling",Personality,Reference,"Science & Math","Behavioral Sciences","Cognitive Psychology"}	2018-08-21	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/original/12390743482722.jpg?key=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE3NTg2OTA3MTIsImlhdCI6MTc1ODY4MzUxMn0.B6taxEZcza3NujhOrY0OrCdSW0fHx_q57Tnen-iAMJM	Scribner	PUBLIC	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264	\N	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264
