 true understanding of health begins with our minds.	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/7969233482399.jpg		288	{"Ellen J. Langer"}	Hardcover	{"MENTAL HEALTH"}	2023-09-05	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/original/7969233482399.jpg?key=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE3NTg2OTg0NDMsImlhdCI6MTc1ODY5MTI0M30.gVGUYat9u3jDoybChj_KiVJqy0wZyGDtBLnro94IUtE	Ballantine Books	PUBLIC	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264	\N	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264
