emory of Light<br/><br/>By Robert Jordan and Teresa Patterson<br/>The World of Robert Jordan's The Wheel of Time<br/><br/>By Robert Jordan, Harriet McDougal, Alan Romanczuk, and Maria Simons<br/>The Wheel of Time Companion<br/><br/>By Robert Jordan and Amy Romanczuk<br/>Patterns of the Wheel: Coloring Art Based on Robert Jordan's The Wheel of Time	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/8462313482633.jpg	Anniversary	784	{"Robert Jordan"}	Hardcover	{"RAND AL'THOR (FICTITIOUS CHARACTER)_FICTION",FICTION_FANTASY_EPIC}	2020-10-06	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/original/8462313482633.jpg?key=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE3NTg3MDg2NjAsImlhdCI6MTc1ODcwMTQ2MH0.RH8T0mp4ZzLmHr33mu-nm0_gB1yjiGo86LRVhNs08q8	Tor Books	PUBLIC	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264	\N	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264
