ng, not even dragon fire, may be enough to save them in the end.<br/><br/>The Empyrean series is best enjoyed in order.<br/>Reading Order:<br/>Book #1 Fourth Wing<br/>Book #2 Iron Flame	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/6474473482775.jpg		640	{"Rebecca Yarros"}	Hardcover	{"Science Fiction & Fantasy",Fantasy,Epic,Romantic}	2023-11-07	https://images.isbndb.com/covers/original/6474473482775.jpg?key=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE3NTg3MDkwNDIsImlhdCI6MTc1ODcwMTg0Mn0.5A-ei7HiJTJtl2DSrR9mHl5qN7efrSrOPpPWTggZY18	Entangled: Red Tower Books	PUBLIC	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264	\N	2025-11-25 07:12:10.264
